    "updated_at": "2021-09-09T21:55:39Z",
    "body": "> I filed [WebAudio/web-audio-api#1563](https://github.com/WebAudio/web-audio-api/issues/1563) to get more clarity on that method.\r\n\r\nLooking through that issue and what became of it, I've concluded that the current \"MP3 without ID3\" algorithm is misplaced, confusing, and potentially harmful. We should not be sniffing MP3 data so deeply in this context.",
